16
00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:37.054
Frequency buckets let us find the least-used keys directly. OrderedDict provides constant average time

17
00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:45.124
removal and insertion while retaining recency within a frequency. A minimum-frequency pointer identifies the

18
00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:53.758
